A '''Stridersurfer''' is a type of [[Mob]] found in the {{zone|Stride-Ember Fissure}}. It is also a [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up there.

== Spawning ==
{{Lv|58}} '''Stridersurfers''' spawn in the {{zone|Stride-Ember Fissure}}, while {{Lv|62}} ones can be fished up as a [[Sea Creatures|Sea Creature]].

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for {{Lv|62}} '''Stridersurfer''' is {{Green|200}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|100%|1|1|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase its weight:
{| class="wikitable"
|-
!Condition
!<span title="Stacks multiplicatively">Weight</span>
|-
|{{Item|Whale Bait}}, {{Item|Light Bait}}, and {{Item|Dark Bait}}
|{{Green|1.25x}}
|}

(Note that this weight modification will have no effect in practice, since it is the only Sea Creature that can be caught in this pool.)

