== Behavior ==
'''Stridersurfers''' walk around in the {{Zone|Stride-Ember Fissure}}. On death, they drop 1 {{Item|Gill Membrane}}: they also have a chance to drop {{Item|Sturdy Bone}}s. They can also be hunted to obtain the {{Item|Stridersurfer Shard}}, which can be syphoned to grant the {{Attr|Magmatic Ruler}} attribute.

